01:16.620 --> 01:18.586
Oh, no, I lost my pen.
哦，不，我把笔丢了。

01:18.689 --> 01:20.000
You can borrow mine.
你可以借我的。

01:20.103 --> 01:21.241
Thanks.
谢谢。

01:21.344 --> 01:23.793
I lost something once.
我有一次丢过东西。

01:23.896 --> 01:28.620
I lost something
I couldn't live without...
我丢了东西
没有...我就活不下去

01:28.724 --> 01:29.862
My identity.
我的身份。

01:29.965 --> 01:32.275
So anyway, thanks for the pen.
无论如何，谢谢你的笔。

01:32.379 --> 01:33.896
No problem, hon.
没问题，亲爱的。

01:34.000 --> 01:37.206
It all started last week...
Monday morning to be exact...
一切都从上周开始……
确切地说是星期一早上...

01:37.310 --> 01:40.586
The day I lost my identity.
我失去身份的那一天。

01:40.689 --> 01:42.655
I got to go.
我得走了。

01:46.689 --> 01:49.620
Good morning, world,
and all who inhabit it.
早上好，世界，
以及所有居住其中的人。

01:49.724 --> 01:51.586
Awk! Gary, help! I can't see.
哎呀！加里，救命啊！我看不到。

01:51.689 --> 01:52.758
Gary!
加里！

01:52.862 --> 01:54.689
Gary, are you there?
加里，你在吗？

01:57.482 --> 01:59.586
Gary? Gary, buddy?
加里？加里，伙计？

01:59.689 --> 02:01.620
I need you to be my eyes, okay?
我需要你做我的眼睛，好吗？

02:01.724 --> 02:03.586
Am I near the bathroom?
我靠近浴室吗？

02:08.896 --> 02:12.379
Gary? Gary? Gar?
加里？加里？加尔？

02:17.000 --> 02:18.034
Gary.
加里.

02:18.137 --> 02:20.689
Now that my horrific
incident of terror is over
现在我的可怕的
恐怖事件已经结束

02:20.793 --> 02:21.827
how 'bout some breakfast?
吃点早餐怎么样？

02:21.931 --> 02:24.482
♪ The most important meal
of the day ♪
♪ 最重要的一餐
当日的♪

02:24.586 --> 02:27.586
♪ Serving it up
Gary's way... pop! ♪
♪ 上菜
加里的方式...流行！ ♪

02:27.689 --> 02:29.068
Enjoy, buddy.
享受吧，伙计。

02:29.172 --> 02:32.241
Mmm. You know, I've been feeding
this to Gary for years
嗯。你知道吗，我一直在喂食
多年来这对加里来说

02:32.344 --> 02:34.000
and I don't even know
what it tastes like.
我什至不知道
味道如何。

02:37.758 --> 02:39.034
Bleah!
哎呀！

02:39.137 --> 02:40.275
Bleah!
哎呀！

02:40.379 --> 02:41.620
Bleah!
哎呀！

02:41.724 --> 02:43.413
What is it, Peterson?
这是什么，彼得森？

02:43.517 --> 02:44.724
I'm not sure.
我不知道。

02:44.827 --> 02:46.724
I feel... a disturbance.
我感到……一种干扰。

02:46.827 --> 02:49.034
That was the worst thing
I've ever tasted.
那是最糟糕的事情
我曾经尝过。

02:49.137 --> 02:52.000
Oh, well, at least
I'll never have to do it again.
哦，好吧，至少
我再也不用这么做了。

02:52.103 --> 02:53.275
Barnacles!
藤壶！

02:53.379 --> 02:55.793
All these shenanigans
made me late for work.
所有这些恶作剧
让我上班迟到了。

02:57.448 --> 02:58.896
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

02:59.793 --> 03:01.448
All right.
好的。

03:03.758 --> 03:05.068
Hi, SpongeBob.
嗨，海绵宝宝。

03:05.172 --> 03:06.379
Hi, Patrick.
嗨，帕特里克。

03:07.793 --> 03:08.793
♪ La-la-la-la-la-la-la
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦

03:08.896 --> 03:10.482
♪ La-la-la-la
la-la-la-la-lah ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦
啦啦啦啦啦♪

03:10.586 --> 03:12.344
♪ La-la-la-la-la-la-la-lah
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦

03:12.448 --> 03:13.827
♪ La-la-la-la
la-la-la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦
啦啦啦♪

03:13.931 --> 03:15.758
♪ La-la-la-la-la-la-la
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦啦啦啦

03:15.862 --> 03:17.655
♪ La-la-la-la
la-la-la... ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦
啦啦啦……♪

03:17.758 --> 03:18.896
Wait a minute.
等一下。

03:19.000 --> 03:20.965
When exactly did you
lose your identity?
你具体什么时候
失去你的身份？

03:21.068 --> 03:22.620
Yeah, and who's Patrick?
是啊，帕特里克是谁？

03:22.724 --> 03:25.379
Why did you eat Snail-Po?
你为什么吃蜗牛宝？

03:25.482 --> 03:26.724
Have patience, good people.
要有耐心，善良的人。

03:26.827 --> 03:28.827
A great story can't be rushed.
一个伟大的故事不能操之过急。

03:28.931 --> 03:31.586
However, I willskip ahead
to The Krusty Krab.
不过，我会跳过
到蟹堡王。

03:31.689 --> 03:34.137
Order up!
赶快下单吧！

03:36.551 --> 03:39.655
One Krabby Patty, grilled
with the fiery warmth
一份烤蟹肉饼
带着火热的温暖

03:39.758 --> 03:41.482
of my beating heart. Enjoy.
我跳动的心。享受。

03:41.586 --> 03:42.620
Thanks.
谢谢。

03:42.724 --> 03:43.724
Uh...
呃...

03:45.206 --> 03:46.275
Oh.
哦。

03:46.379 --> 03:47.655
Is there a problem?
有问题吗？

03:47.758 --> 03:49.862
Well, you really should
be wearing a name tag
嗯，你真的应该
佩戴名牌

03:49.965 --> 03:51.655
so I can thank you properly.
这样我就可以好好地感谢你了。

03:51.758 --> 03:53.620
While it is against
my philosophy
虽然是反对
我的哲学

03:53.724 --> 03:55.206
to disagree with a customer
不同意顾客的意见

03:55.310 --> 03:58.724
I must point out that I am,
in fact, wearing a name tag...
我必须指出，我是，
事实上，戴着名牌...

03:58.827 --> 04:00.931
right here.
就在这里。

04:03.793 --> 04:04.793
Huh?
啊？

04:11.517 --> 04:12.862
Uh... SpongeBob.
呃……海绵宝宝。

04:12.965 --> 04:14.310
Oh, Squidward, it's terrible.
哦，章鱼哥，太可怕了。

04:14.413 --> 04:17.448
It's the most terrible thing
that's ever happened to me.
这是最可怕的事情
这曾经发生在我身上。

04:17.551 --> 04:18.862
I lost my name tag.
我丢失了我的名牌。

04:21.827 --> 04:23.931
Pourquoi?!
普尔奎伊？！

04:24.034 --> 04:25.620
SpongeBob, take it easy.
海绵宝宝，放轻松。

04:25.724 --> 04:27.275
I'm sure you can get a new one.
我确信你能得到一件新的。

04:27.379 --> 04:29.862
But I don't want
a new one, Squidward.
但我不想
一个新的，章鱼哥。

04:29.965 --> 04:31.896
My name tag is
out there somewhere.
我的名字标签是
就在外面的某个地方。

04:32.000 --> 04:33.551
Lost... Hungry...
迷路了……饿了……

04:33.655 --> 04:35.000
Who will help it?
谁来帮助它？

04:35.103 --> 04:36.183
What if someone's using it?
如果有人使用怎么办？

04:38.448 --> 04:39.965
All right, nobody move!
好了，没人动！

04:40.068 --> 04:42.275
This is a bank robbery!
这是抢劫银行！

04:42.379 --> 04:44.413
Attica!
阿提卡！

04:46.482 --> 04:47.827
I'm innocent, I tell ya.
我是无辜的，我告诉你。

04:50.793 --> 04:52.758
Wow... Ooh...
哇……哦……

04:52.862 --> 04:53.758
Squidward, what happened?
章鱼哥，发生什么事了？

04:53.862 --> 04:55.310
Huh? Oh, you fainted
啊？噢，你晕倒了

04:55.413 --> 04:57.206
because you lost your
name tag or something.
因为你失去了你的
名字标签什么的。

04:58.620 --> 04:59.620
Huh?
啊？

05:02.172 --> 05:04.724
SpongeBob, will you get
ahold of yourself?
海绵宝宝，你会得到吗
坚持自己吗？

05:04.827 --> 05:06.827
Since when is losing
your name tag
从什么时候开始失去
你的名字标签

05:06.931 --> 05:08.068
the end of the world?
世界末日？

05:08.172 --> 05:09.793
Attention, all employees!
全体员工注意了！

05:09.896 --> 05:11.344
Just a quick heads-up, boys.
只是快速提醒一下，孩子们。

05:11.448 --> 05:14.448
There's going to be
a surprise uniform inspection
将会有
突击统一检查

05:14.551 --> 05:15.758
in one hour.
一小时内。

05:15.862 --> 05:19.103
Anyone who doesn't pass,
gets the boot.
凡是没有通过的人，
获得引导。

05:21.275 --> 05:22.517
This boot, to be exact.
确切地说，是这款靴子。

05:22.620 --> 05:23.758
It's very stinky
非常臭

05:23.862 --> 05:24.907
and you have to wear it all day.
而且你必须整天戴着它。

05:24.931 --> 05:26.103
See you in an hour.
一小时后见。

05:31.068 --> 05:33.068
SpongeBob, if you really want
海绵宝宝，如果你真的想要的话

05:33.172 --> 05:36.827
to find your name tag,
just retrace your steps.
找到您的姓名标签，
只要原路返回即可。

05:36.931 --> 05:39.172
Retrace my steps?
追寻我的足迹？

05:39.275 --> 05:40.931
Squidward, you're a genius.
章鱼哥，你真是个天才。

05:41.034 --> 05:42.310
Huh. Huh. A genius.
呵呵。呵呵。一个天才。

05:42.413 --> 05:44.965
Well, I don't know
about that, but...
嗯，我不知道
关于那件事，但是……

05:45.068 --> 05:47.000
Cover me till I get back, okay?
掩护我直到我回来，好吗？

05:47.103 --> 05:48.310
Oh, sure, sure.
哦，当然，当然。

05:48.413 --> 05:50.793
A genius. Well,
how about.... Hey!
一个天才。嗯，
怎么样……嘿！

05:50.896 --> 05:52.000
Let's see.
让我们来看看。

05:52.103 --> 05:53.383
If I'm going to retrace my steps
如果我要回溯我的脚步

05:53.413 --> 05:55.655
I got to remember
everything I did this morning.
我必须记住
我今天早上所做的一切。

05:55.758 --> 05:56.862
Hi, SpongeBob.
嗨，海绵宝宝。

05:56.965 --> 05:58.275
Oh, hi, Patrick.
哦，嗨，帕特里克。

05:58.379 --> 06:00.413
You said hi to me
this morning, right?
你向我打招呼
今天早上，对吗？

06:00.517 --> 06:01.413
As I do every morning.
正如我每天早上所做的那样。

06:01.517 --> 06:03.103
Well, I need you to do it again.
好吧，我需要你再做一次。

06:03.206 --> 06:05.448
That wasn't part
of the deal, Squarepants.
那不是一部分
这笔交易，Squarepants。

06:05.551 --> 06:07.793
Patrick, what are
you talking about?
帕特里克，什么是
你在说什么？

06:07.896 --> 06:10.034
My hellos aren't just
some tape recording
我的问候不只是
一些磁带录音

06:10.137 --> 06:12.448
that you can rewind
and play over and over.
你可以倒带
并一遍又一遍地玩。

06:12.551 --> 06:13.620
They're special.
他们很特别。

06:13.724 --> 06:15.000
Patrick, this is an emergency.
帕特里克，这是紧急情况。

06:15.103 --> 06:16.827
I lost my name tag this morning
今天早上我丢失了名牌

06:16.931 --> 06:18.482
and I need to retrace my steps.
我需要原路返回。

06:18.586 --> 06:20.551
You lost your name tag?
你丢了名牌吗？

06:23.206 --> 06:26.758
Okay, Patrick, you
know the plan, right?!
好吧，帕特里克，你
知道计划吧？！

06:26.862 --> 06:28.413
I got it, I got it.
我明白了，我明白了。

06:28.517 --> 06:31.896
You're going to retrace your
steps and when you walk by me
你将追溯你的
脚步以及当你走过我身边时

06:32.000 --> 06:34.275
I say, "Hi,"
just like this morning.
我说：“嗨”
就像今天早上一样。

06:34.379 --> 06:35.551
Perfect!
完美的！

06:35.655 --> 06:38.034
Mm, I guess I should start
with when I woke up.
嗯，我想我应该开始了
当我醒来时。

06:38.137 --> 06:39.137
I sure hope this works.
我当然希望这能起作用。

06:40.758 --> 06:43.827
Good morning, world,
and all who inhabit it.
早上好，世界，
以及所有居住其中的人。

06:43.931 --> 06:45.448
Awk!
哎呀！

06:48.965 --> 06:50.068
So far, so good.
到目前为止，一切都很好。

06:54.724 --> 06:56.275
I don't see my name tag up here.
我在这里没有看到我的名字标签。

06:57.482 --> 07:00.034
Now that my horrific incident
of terror is over
现在我的可怕事件
恐怖已经结束

07:00.137 --> 07:02.172
how 'bout some breakfast?
吃点早餐怎么样？

07:02.275 --> 07:04.103
♪ The most important meal
of the day ♪
♪ 最重要的一餐
当日的♪

07:04.206 --> 07:05.724
♪ Serving it up
Gary's way. ♪
♪ 上菜
加里的方式。 ♪

07:07.793 --> 07:09.000
Bleah!
哎呀！

07:09.103 --> 07:10.965
Okay. Next I just have
to walk outside
好的。接下来我只有
到外面走走

07:11.068 --> 07:12.793
and say hi to Patrick.
并向帕特里克问好。

07:16.103 --> 07:16.965
Patrick!
帕特里克！

07:17.068 --> 07:18.137
What?
什么？

07:18.241 --> 07:20.724
You were supposed
to say hi to me.
你本来应该
跟我打招呼。

07:20.827 --> 07:22.034
Hi.
你好。

07:22.137 --> 07:25.724
Oh. All right,
let's take it from the top.
哦。好吧，
让我们从上往下看。

07:26.758 --> 07:27.965
Bye, SpongeBob.
再见，海绵宝宝。

07:28.068 --> 07:30.379
Don't forget your
line this time!
别忘了你的
这次上线！

07:30.482 --> 07:31.620
I won't.
我不会。

07:31.724 --> 07:34.103
Good morning, world
and all who inhabit it.
早上好，世界
以及所有居住其中的人。

07:35.931 --> 07:38.241
♪ The most important
meal of the day ♪
♪ 最重要的是
当天的一餐♪

07:38.344 --> 07:40.241
♪ La-la-la, Gary's way
Bleah!
♪ 啦啦啦，加里的方式
哎呀！

07:43.517 --> 07:45.965
Patrick, why
didn't you say hi to me?
帕特里克，为什么
你没跟我打招呼吗？

07:46.068 --> 07:47.689
What's my motivation?
我的动机是什么？

07:47.793 --> 07:49.310
Forget the motivation.
忘记动机。

07:49.413 --> 07:50.413
Just say hi!
就打个招呼吧！

07:56.689 --> 07:57.586
Hi, Patrick.
嗨，帕特里克。

07:57.689 --> 07:58.965
Wait! I'm Patrick.
等待！我是帕特里克。

07:59.068 --> 08:00.068
I'm sorry. Sorry.
对不起。对不起。

08:00.103 --> 08:01.965
I'm sorry.
对不起。

08:02.068 --> 08:03.724
Let's try it again.
让我们再试一次。

08:08.448 --> 08:09.068
Bleah!
哎呀！

08:09.172 --> 08:10.827
Hi, SpongeBoob.
嗨，海绵宝宝。

08:10.931 --> 08:11.965
SpongeBoob?!
海绵布布？！

08:12.068 --> 08:13.793
I-I said... ha-ha!
我、我说……哈哈！

08:13.896 --> 08:15.689
Who's SpongeBoob?
海绵宝宝是谁？

08:15.793 --> 08:17.586
I said SpongeBoob!
我说的是海绵宝宝！

08:19.137 --> 08:20.862
Again, again. Sorry, people.
再一次，再一次。对不起，各位。

08:24.172 --> 08:25.896
♪ The most important
meal of the day ♪
♪ 最重要的是
当天的一餐♪

08:26.000 --> 08:27.896
♪ Yeah, yeah, Gary's way.
Bleah!
♪ 是的，是的，加里的方式。
哎呀！

08:30.103 --> 08:31.827
I got the giggles.
我笑了。

08:31.931 --> 08:33.655
Oh, what's the use?
哦，那有什么用呢？

08:33.758 --> 08:36.965
I'll never find my name tag
in time for inspection.
我永远找不到我的名字标签
及时进行检查。

08:37.068 --> 08:38.206
Well, what did you do
嗯，你做了什么

08:38.310 --> 08:40.172
after I said hi to
you this morning?
在我打招呼之后
今天早上你吗？

08:40.275 --> 08:42.172
Hmm. Let's see.
唔。让我们来看看。

08:42.275 --> 08:44.068
I skipped merrily
to The Krusty Krab.
我高兴地跳了起来
到蟹堡王。

08:44.172 --> 08:45.965
Said hello to old man Jenkins.
向老詹金斯打招呼。

08:46.068 --> 08:47.068
Hi, Mr. J.
你好，J 先生。

08:47.172 --> 08:49.206
Placed an apple
on Mr. Krabs's desk
放了一个苹果
在蟹老板的桌子上

08:49.310 --> 08:51.379
and that's about it.
就是这样。

08:51.482 --> 08:53.793
Oh, and these two guys
threw me in the dumpster.
哦，还有这两个人
threw me in the dumpster.

08:55.103 --> 08:56.172
Yi-yi-yi.
依依依。

08:56.275 --> 08:57.931
Good one, guys!
好啊，伙计们！

08:58.034 --> 08:59.103
Whoa!
哇！

08:59.206 --> 09:00.448
That's it!
就是这样！

09:00.551 --> 09:03.172
Your name tag is in the apple
你的名字标签在苹果里

09:03.275 --> 09:04.931
on Mr. Krabs' desk.
在蟹老板的桌子上。

09:05.034 --> 09:06.275
Patrick, you're a genius.
帕特里克，你是个天才。

09:06.379 --> 09:09.000
Oh, wait, he's probably
thrown it away by now.
哦，等等，他可能是
现在就把它扔掉了。

09:09.103 --> 09:11.413
Well, then, we'll
look in the dumpster.
那么，我们就
看看垃圾箱。

09:15.379 --> 09:17.172
What is that stench?
那是什么臭味？

09:17.275 --> 09:19.482
That is the stench of discovery.
这就是发现的恶臭。

09:19.586 --> 09:22.413
Come on, buddy, I'll
give you a boost.
来吧，伙计，我会
给你动力。

09:23.103 --> 09:24.482
Hop on, pal.
上车吧，朋友。

09:24.586 --> 09:26.206
Yup-ho!
是啊嗬！

09:26.310 --> 09:28.862
Hey, it's not so bad,
once you get used to it.
嘿，事情没那么糟糕，
一旦你习惯了。

09:28.965 --> 09:31.068
I wish I had a nose.
我希望我有一个鼻子。

09:31.172 --> 09:33.724
Come on in, buddy,
the garbage is fine.
进来吧，伙计，
垃圾还好。

09:33.827 --> 09:35.896
Cannonball!
炮弹！

09:40.206 --> 09:41.206
You look over there
你看那边

09:41.310 --> 09:42.586
and I'll look over here.
我会看看这里。

09:42.689 --> 09:43.689
Okay.
好的。

09:46.896 --> 09:47.793
Patrick.
帕特里克.

09:47.896 --> 09:49.689
I'm looking, I'm looking.
我在找，我在找。

09:49.793 --> 09:51.000
Patrick.
帕特里克.

09:51.103 --> 09:52.103
Patrick!
帕特里克！

09:52.206 --> 09:53.620
I'm looking as fast as I can.
我正在尽可能快地寻找。

09:53.724 --> 09:54.931
Patrick!!
帕特里克！！

09:57.034 --> 09:58.793
Thank you.
谢谢。

09:58.896 --> 10:00.310
Here, let me get that.
在这里，让我明白这一点。

10:00.413 --> 10:04.206
Hey, look... a
Stingray 5000 single.
嘿，看……一个
黄貂鱼 5000 单。

10:04.310 --> 10:05.862
Hey, these guys rock!
嘿，这些家伙摇滚！

10:05.965 --> 10:08.000
Why would anybody
throw this away?
为什么有人会
把这个扔掉吗？

10:08.103 --> 10:10.586
Have you forgotten
what we're looking for
你忘记了吗
我们在寻找什么

10:10.689 --> 10:13.310
knee deep in yesterday's
Top 40 songs?
昨天的膝盖深
前 40 首歌曲？

10:13.413 --> 10:14.448
Yes.
是的。

10:14.551 --> 10:17.000
I'll give you a hint:
Two words.
我给你一个提示：
两个字。

10:17.103 --> 10:18.241
First word, "my."
第一个词是“我的”。

10:18.344 --> 10:20.344
Second word, "name tag."
第二个词，“名牌”。

10:20.448 --> 10:22.482
Could I have another hint?
我可以有另一个提示吗？

10:24.965 --> 10:26.379
Patrick, I would love
to sit here
帕特里克，我会喜欢
坐在这里

10:26.482 --> 10:28.206
and play "20 Questions" with you
和你一起玩“20个问题”

10:28.310 --> 10:30.620
but I've only got
one minute till inspection.
但我只有
距离检查还有一分钟。

10:30.724 --> 10:31.931
Aah! One minute?!
啊啊！一分钟？！

10:32.034 --> 10:33.172
Hurry, Patrick!
快点，帕特里克！

10:33.275 --> 10:34.689
We don't have much time.
我们没有太多时间。

10:39.379 --> 10:40.551
Hey, SpongeBob.
嘿，海绵宝宝。

10:40.655 --> 10:41.655
Not now, Patrick.
不是现在，帕特里克。

10:41.724 --> 10:43.206
I know where your name tag is.
我知道你的名牌在哪里。

10:43.310 --> 10:44.551
Where? Where?
在哪里？在哪里？

10:44.655 --> 10:45.896
Uh...
呃...

10:46.000 --> 10:47.275
I can't remember.
我不记得了。

10:47.379 --> 10:50.137
Patrick, I don't
have time for this.
帕特里克，我不
有时间做这个。

10:50.241 --> 10:51.137
There it is!
就在那里！

10:51.241 --> 10:52.620
Where?!
在哪里？！

10:52.724 --> 10:54.103
Uh. I forgot again.
呃。我又忘记了。

10:54.206 --> 10:56.551
Patrick, are you with me
or against me?
帕特里克，你和我在一起吗
还是反对我？

10:56.655 --> 10:59.517
Well, could you give me a hint?
嗯，你能给我一个提示吗？

10:59.620 --> 11:00.862
There! I see it!
那里！我看到了！

11:00.965 --> 11:03.310
Yeah, yeah, yeah...
The boy who cried, "Name tag."
是啊是啊……
那个男孩喊道：“名牌。”

11:03.413 --> 11:04.793
If you're not going to help me
如果你不打算帮助我

11:04.896 --> 11:07.206
then just go crawl
back under your rock.
然后就去爬行
回到你的岩石下面。

11:07.310 --> 11:11.206
Well, at least I don't
wear my shirt backwards.
好吧，至少我不这么认为
把我的衬衫反穿。

11:11.310 --> 11:14.482
My shirt backward? What the...?
我的衬衫反了？什么……？

11:15.413 --> 11:17.310
My shirt's on backwards!
我的衬衫穿反了！

11:17.413 --> 11:20.344
I had my identity all along.
我一直都有自己的身份。

11:21.551 --> 11:23.206
Oh, and just in time.
哦，来得正是时候。

11:23.310 --> 11:24.827
Thanks, Patrick.
谢谢，帕特里克。

11:24.931 --> 11:26.379
Don't mention it, buddy.
别提了，伙计。

11:27.206 --> 11:30.241
Fall in for inspection!
过来接受检查！

11:30.344 --> 11:32.379
All right, you two.
好吧，你们两个。

11:33.551 --> 11:35.551
Hat and uniform
seem to be in order.
帽子和制服
看起来很正常。

11:35.655 --> 11:36.827
Hmm...
唔...

11:38.068 --> 11:40.655
Promise me you'll shave
tonight and you pass.
答应我你会刮胡子
今晚你就过去了。

11:40.758 --> 11:42.000
Hoo-rah.
呼啦。

11:42.862 --> 11:44.103
Okay, boy, your turn.
好吧，孩子，轮到你了。

11:44.206 --> 11:46.931
I think you'll find
everything ship-shape.
我想你会发现
一切都是船形的。

11:49.310 --> 11:52.275
Jumping jellyfish,
what's that stench?
跳跃的水母，
那是什么臭味？

11:52.379 --> 11:54.206
Uh, discovery?
呃，发现？

11:55.310 --> 11:58.965
And that's how I got
my identity back.
这就是我得到的
我的身份回来了。

11:59.068 --> 12:00.344
Welp, that's my story.
好吧，这就是我的故事。

12:02.482 --> 12:04.655
Well, you managed
to kill 11 minutes.
好吧，你成功了
消磨11分钟。

12:06.413 --> 12:08.551
Thanks, uh...
谢谢，呃...

12:08.655 --> 12:09.655
Betty.
贝蒂。

12:09.724 --> 12:11.586
What? Oh, sweetie,
I'm not Betty.
什么？哦，亲爱的，
我不是贝蒂。

12:11.689 --> 12:15.310
I just borrowed her uniform
while mine's at the cleaners.
我刚借了她的制服
而我的则在清洁工那里。

12:28.620 --> 12:31.862
Ah, The Krusty Krab
啊，蟹堡王

12:31.965 --> 12:34.620
home of the delicious
Krabby Patty
美味之家
蟹肉饼

12:34.724 --> 12:36.827
and its super-secret recipe.
以及它的超级秘密配方。

12:36.931 --> 12:39.448
Attention, Krusty Krab crew!
蟹堡王工作人员请注意！

12:39.551 --> 12:42.000
All hands report immediately!
全体人员立即报告！

12:42.103 --> 12:44.931
Fry Cook SpongeBob
reporting, sir!
炒海绵宝宝厨师
报告，先生！

12:45.034 --> 12:47.000
What's all the yelling about?
大家都在喊什么？

12:47.103 --> 12:48.931
Today is the 25th anniversary
今天是25周年纪念日

12:49.034 --> 12:51.655
of the first time
me archenemy Plankton
第一次
我的大敌浮游生物

12:51.758 --> 12:53.620
ever tried to steal me secret
曾经试图窃取我的秘密

12:53.724 --> 12:55.034
Krabby Patty formula.
蟹黄饼配方。

12:55.137 --> 12:57.310
Can I have the secret formula?
可以给我秘方吗？

12:57.413 --> 12:58.689
No! Okay.
不！好的。

12:58.793 --> 13:00.862
But he was persistent.
但他很执着。

13:00.965 --> 13:02.965
Pretty please? Uh-huh.
请问漂亮吗？嗯嗯。

13:03.068 --> 13:04.482
He used disguise...
他用了伪装...

13:07.482 --> 13:10.206
Super-science...
超科学...

13:13.655 --> 13:16.206
civil disobedience...
公民不服从...

13:16.310 --> 13:18.793
and I always came out on top.
我总是名列前茅。

13:18.896 --> 13:20.103
Fascinating.
迷人。

13:20.206 --> 13:22.931
But thousands of failures
have made him crafty
但数以千计的失败
使他变得狡猾

13:23.034 --> 13:25.241
so keep your eyes open.
所以请睁大眼睛。

13:25.344 --> 13:27.206
You never know
what trick he'll use
你永远不知道
他会用什么伎俩

13:27.310 --> 13:29.586
to steal me secret
Krabby Patty formula.
偷我的秘密
蟹黄饼配方。

13:29.689 --> 13:32.310
What a quaint restaurant.
多么古雅的餐厅啊。

13:32.413 --> 13:34.827
I think I will sample
their wares.
我想我会采样
他们的商品。

13:34.931 --> 13:36.827
Ooh, how weird...
哦，多么奇怪啊...

13:36.931 --> 13:39.172
A machine made to
look like a customer.
一台机器被用来
看起来像一个顾客。

13:39.275 --> 13:42.448
SpongeBob, why don't you go
hose out the men's room.
海绵宝宝你怎么还不走
用软管冲洗男厕所。

13:42.551 --> 13:43.965
With pleasure, sir!
很高兴，先生！

13:44.068 --> 13:46.068
I'lltake this one.
我要这个。

13:46.172 --> 13:49.655
Welcome to The Krusty Krab, sir.
先生，欢迎来到蟹堡王。

13:49.758 --> 13:51.344
May I help you?
我可以帮你吗？

13:51.448 --> 13:52.482
Yes, please.
是的，请。

13:52.586 --> 13:55.068
I'd like an order
of chili coral bits.
我想要一个订单
辣椒珊瑚块。

13:55.172 --> 13:57.965
You sure you don't want
a Krabby Patty?
你确定你不想要
蟹肉饼？

13:58.068 --> 13:59.793
No, thank you.
不，谢谢。

13:59.896 --> 14:01.310
Will this cover it?
这个会覆盖吗？

14:01.413 --> 14:03.344
Uh... sure.
呃...当然。

14:03.448 --> 14:05.379
Here you go.
干得好。

14:07.034 --> 14:09.034
Good day.
再会。

14:09.137 --> 14:11.827
Hm. I was sure it was
one of Plankton's tricks.
嗯。我确定是
浮游生物的伎俩之一。

14:11.931 --> 14:13.482
Well, at least his money's good.
好吧，至少他的钱还不错。

14:14.827 --> 14:17.413
Aha!
啊哈！

14:17.517 --> 14:21.068
Plankton! You knew I would
never distrust a dollar!
浮游生物！你知道我会
永远不要不相信一美元！

14:21.172 --> 14:22.551
That's right, Krabs.
没错，蟹蟹。

14:22.655 --> 14:25.931
Now, hand over the secret
Krabby Patty formula!
现在，交出秘密
蟹黄派配方！

14:26.034 --> 14:27.827
Or what?
或者什么？

14:27.931 --> 14:29.275
I don't know.
我不知道。

14:29.379 --> 14:31.413
I never thought
I'd get this far.
我从没想过
我会走到这一步。

14:31.517 --> 14:34.344
Well, then, allow me to
suggest your next move.
那么，请允许我
建议你的下一步行动。

14:36.034 --> 14:38.620
Yowww!
哟哟！

14:38.724 --> 14:40.344
Curse you, Krabs!
蟹蟹们，诅咒你们！

14:43.724 --> 14:45.482
And now for the chaser.
现在是追逐者。

14:51.689 --> 14:53.344
You just wait, Krabs!
蟹蟹们，你等着吧！

14:53.448 --> 14:56.517
Next time I'll...
下次我会...

14:56.620 --> 14:58.137
Who am I kidding?
我在跟谁开玩笑呢？

14:58.241 --> 15:02.344
At least I can go home
to a wife who understands.
至少我可以回家
给一个能理解的妻子。

15:02.448 --> 15:06.172
So, tell me what happened.
那么，告诉我发生了什么事。

15:06.275 --> 15:08.103
I don't want to talk about it.
我不想谈论它。

15:08.206 --> 15:10.103
Talking will make
you feel better.
说话会让
你感觉好多了。

15:10.206 --> 15:11.517
Leave me alone.
请别打扰我。

15:11.620 --> 15:15.000
That's your problem...
You never let anyone in.
那是你的问题...
你从来不让任何人进来。

15:15.103 --> 15:16.862
Plankton the rock,
Plankton the loner.
浮游生物岩石，
浮游生物是孤独的。

15:16.965 --> 15:18.758
And she's off,
ladies and gentlemen.
而她却下班了
女士们、先生们。

15:18.862 --> 15:20.310
You have to do
everything yourself.
你必须做
一切都是你自己。

15:20.413 --> 15:23.000
That's why everything you try
ends up like this.
这就是为什么你尝试的一切
最终是这样的。

15:25.068 --> 15:26.172
And like this.
像这样。

15:27.931 --> 15:30.000
And more recently, like this.
最近，就像这样。

15:36.896 --> 15:39.034
I'm a failure!
我是个失败者！

15:39.137 --> 15:41.103
It's not that bad.
没那么糟糕。

15:41.206 --> 15:43.517
You just require a little help.
你只需要一点帮助。

15:43.620 --> 15:45.482
Maybe some henchmen.
也许是一些追随者。

15:45.586 --> 15:46.586
Henchmen?
追随者？

15:46.620 --> 15:48.344
Yes. What you need to do
是的。你需要做什么

15:48.448 --> 15:51.827
is surround yourself
with muscular tough guys
是围绕着你自己
和肌肉发达的硬汉们

15:51.931 --> 15:54.000
who will do whatever you say.
谁会照你说的做。

15:54.103 --> 15:55.620
I like the sound of that.
我喜欢那个声音。

15:55.724 --> 15:59.655
I'll canvass all the seediest
lowbrow dives in town
我会调查所有最肮脏的
在城里低俗潜水

15:59.758 --> 16:01.413
to find my minions.
去寻找我的爪牙。

16:01.517 --> 16:05.000
And I know just how to speak
their language.
我知道如何说话
他们的语言。

16:05.103 --> 16:08.448
Felicitations, malefactors!
恭喜你，恶人！

16:08.551 --> 16:11.241
I am endeavoring
to misappropriate
我正在努力
挪用

16:11.344 --> 16:13.241
the formulary
for the preparation
处方集
为准备

16:13.344 --> 16:16.103
of affordable comestibles.
负担得起的食品。

16:16.206 --> 16:18.172
Who will join me?!
谁来加入我？！

16:18.275 --> 16:21.413
I don't get it...
No matter what I do
我不明白...
无论我做什么

16:21.517 --> 16:26.103
I always end up being squashed
by someone bigger than me.
我总是被压扁
由比我大的人。

16:26.206 --> 16:28.206
Oh, come on.
哦，来吧。

16:28.310 --> 16:31.620
I think you're overreacting.
我认为你反应过度了。

16:31.724 --> 16:33.172
Sorry.
对不起。

16:33.275 --> 16:35.862
That's okay... I'm no different
没关系...我也不例外

16:35.965 --> 16:39.068
than the millions
of other plankton in the sea.
比数百万
海洋中的其他浮游生物。

16:39.172 --> 16:40.724
The plankton family
浮游生物家族

16:40.827 --> 16:44.172
has always been pushed around
and stepped on.
一直被推来推去
并踩了上去。

16:44.275 --> 16:46.758
Wait. That's it.
等待。就是这样。

16:46.862 --> 16:49.103
Acting alone, we're powerless
单独行动，我们无能为力

16:49.206 --> 16:51.655
but united, the plankton family
但团结起来，浮游生物家族

16:51.758 --> 16:54.517
could be a real pain
in the belly!
可能会很痛苦
在肚子里！

16:54.620 --> 16:58.206
Krabs may think one plankton
is no problem
螃蟹可能认为一种浮游生物
没问题

16:58.310 --> 17:00.379
but let's see him take on two
但让我们看看他对阵两个

17:00.482 --> 17:01.379
or ten
或十个

17:01.482 --> 17:02.206
or 100
或 100

17:02.310 --> 17:03.689
or 1,000!
或 1,000！

17:03.793 --> 17:05.517
And why stop there?
为什么停在那里？

17:05.620 --> 17:12.551
I'll gather every family member
from every corner of the ocean.
我会召集每一个家庭成员
来自海洋的每一个角落。

17:12.655 --> 17:14.689
The entire plankton family
整个浮游生物家族

17:14.793 --> 17:16.724
under one roof!
同一个屋檐下！

17:18.379 --> 17:20.206
Krabs won't stand a chance
螃蟹没有机会

17:20.310 --> 17:22.413
against the staggering intellect
对抗惊人的智力

17:22.517 --> 17:25.724
of a million super-smart
criminal masterminds!
百万超级聪明人
犯罪主谋！

17:25.827 --> 17:28.896
They're here!
他们来了！

17:29.000 --> 17:32.344
Welcome, brethren!
欢迎弟兄们！

17:32.448 --> 17:36.620
Hey, look here, buddy...
It's Cousin Plankton!
嘿，看这里，伙计...
这是浮游生物表弟！

17:36.724 --> 17:38.896
Yee-haw!
呀呀！

17:39.000 --> 17:41.896
I've been away from home
longer than I thought.
我已经离开家了
比我想象的要长。

17:42.000 --> 17:43.448
Well, howdy, cousin!
嗯，你好，表弟！

17:43.551 --> 17:44.655
Guh...
呃……

17:44.758 --> 17:46.241
It's me, Clem.
是我，克莱姆。

17:46.344 --> 17:48.103
Of course, you remember Zeke
当然，你还记得泽克

17:48.206 --> 17:50.206
Rufus, Jete, Billy Bob,
Billy Jim
鲁弗斯、杰特、比利·鲍勃、
比利·吉姆

17:50.310 --> 17:52.206
Billy Billy Bo Willy
Banana Fana Fo Filly
比利·比利·波·威利
香蕉法纳福母马

17:52.310 --> 17:53.586
Doug, Enos...
道格、以诺斯……

17:53.689 --> 17:55.724
Julio, Fletcher McGee,
Rainchild...
胡里奥、弗莱彻·麦基、
雨子...

17:55.827 --> 17:57.655
All right, I get it!
好吧，我明白了！

17:57.758 --> 18:01.413
I mean, uh, come inside,
make yourself at home.
我的意思是，呃，进来吧，
让自己宾至如归。

18:01.517 --> 18:04.689
I'd like you to meet
my computer wife, Karen.
我想让你认识一下
我的电脑妻子凯伦。

18:04.793 --> 18:08.758
Golly, she sure is
pretty, Sheldon.
天哪，她确实是
漂亮，谢尔顿。

18:08.862 --> 18:10.206
Sheldon?
谢尔顿？

18:10.310 --> 18:13.068
Yes, that's my first name.
是的，这是我的名字。

18:14.586 --> 18:17.137
Sheldon?! Will you please...?
谢尔顿？！请你...?

18:17.241 --> 18:19.827
I'm sorry. All right
对不起。好的

18:19.931 --> 18:22.344
as I was saying...
正如我所说...

18:22.448 --> 18:25.103
Okay, we all know
Sheldon's a funny name.
好吧，我们都知道
谢尔顿是一个有趣的名字。

18:25.206 --> 18:28.310
O-ho-kay.
Okay, I'm done.
哦好的。
好吧，我完成了。

18:28.413 --> 18:30.068
No more.Good.
没有了。很好。

18:30.172 --> 18:32.241
To continue.
继续。

18:32.344 --> 18:33.965
Only you can bring honor...
只有你才能带来荣誉……

18:38.068 --> 18:39.172
And dignity...
还有尊严...

18:42.896 --> 18:44.310
Back to the plankton...
回到浮游生物...

18:49.413 --> 18:51.000
For years, it has been my goal
多年来，这一直是我的目标

18:51.103 --> 18:54.137
to acquire
the secret formula for...
获得
秘密配方...

18:54.241 --> 18:56.172
Okay, that's enough!
好吧，够了！

18:56.275 --> 18:57.517
Sheldon! Ha...
谢尔顿！哈...

18:57.620 --> 18:59.689
Bottom line:
we invade The Krusty Krab
底线：
我们入侵了蟹堡王

18:59.793 --> 19:01.896
so I can steal
the secret formula.
这样我就可以偷东西
秘密公式。

19:02.000 --> 19:03.379
What do you think?
你怎么认为？

19:03.482 --> 19:05.103
Uh, what's in it for us?
呃，这对我们有什么好处？

19:05.206 --> 19:07.344
Hey, what about us?!
嘿嘿，那我们呢？！

19:07.448 --> 19:09.724
Well, what do you want?
嗯，你想要什么？

19:09.827 --> 19:13.310
Garsh! Could I get
a new string for my banjo?
嘎什！我可以得到
我的班卓琴需要一根新弦吗？

19:13.413 --> 19:15.758
And another boot
to match this 'un?
还有另一只靴子
匹配这个'un？

19:15.862 --> 19:18.448
And some more memory
for my laptop?
还有一些记忆
对于我的笔记本电脑？

19:18.551 --> 19:20.103
What about root beer?
根汁汽水怎么样？

19:20.206 --> 19:21.655
Root beer?!
根汁汽水？！

19:21.758 --> 19:24.034
Help me get the secret formula
帮我找到秘密配方

19:24.137 --> 19:28.379
and you can have as much
root beer as you can drink.
你可以拥有尽可能多的
根汁汽水可以直接喝。

19:30.103 --> 19:33.689
Victory, thy name is plankton!
胜利，你的名字是浮游生物！

19:33.793 --> 19:36.241
Well, Mr. Squidward
好吧，章鱼哥先生

19:36.344 --> 19:39.137
it's almost closing time,
and we haven't seen
快到关门时间了
我们还没有看到

19:39.241 --> 19:41.620
eye or antenna
of old Plankton for hours.
眼睛或天线
老浮游生物几个小时。

19:41.724 --> 19:45.137
Yes, sir, I think this time,
he's finally given up...
是的，先生，我想这一次，
他终于放弃了……

19:45.241 --> 19:48.379
Attention,
Krusty Krab management.
注意，
蟹堡王管理。

19:48.482 --> 19:50.206
This is your better speaking.
这是你更好的演讲。

19:50.310 --> 19:51.448
What?!
什么？！

19:51.551 --> 19:54.413
I have the restaurant
surrounded.
我有餐厅
包围。

19:54.517 --> 19:56.448
Give me the secret formula
给我秘密配方

19:56.551 --> 19:59.310
or I'll destroy The Krusty Krab.
不然我就毁掉蟹堡王。

19:59.413 --> 20:01.655
Eh, you and what army, bug?
呃，你和什么军队，虫子？

20:01.758 --> 20:03.310
What army?
什么军队？

20:03.413 --> 20:04.862
What army?!
什么军队？！

20:04.965 --> 20:07.379
Look around you, Krabs.
看看你的周围，蟹蟹们。

20:07.482 --> 20:09.862
You planted grass?
你种草了吗？

20:09.965 --> 20:11.034
Grass?!
草？！

20:15.344 --> 20:16.344
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

20:23.275 --> 20:25.758
You'll never get away with it,
Plankton!
你永远都逃脱不了它
浮游生物！

20:25.862 --> 20:29.172
You're right...
the pipes are
much too narrow.
你是对的...
管道是
太窄了。

20:29.275 --> 20:34.482
Besides, what I really want
is the Krabby Patty formula.
除此之外，我真正想要的是什么
是蟹黄派的配方。

20:34.586 --> 20:36.758
Well, you might as well
forget it!
嗯，你也可以
算了！

20:36.862 --> 20:39.448
The formula is locked away
in me safe
公式已被锁定
在我安全的情况下

20:39.551 --> 20:41.793
and I'll never give you
the combination.
我永远不会给你
的组合。

20:43.275 --> 20:44.310
Silence!
沉默！

20:44.413 --> 20:47.344
Whoa! Whoa! Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!
哇！哇！哇！哇！哇！

20:48.965 --> 20:52.241
I think you'll find
we're more than capable
我想你会发现
我们有能力

20:52.344 --> 20:55.275
of figuring it out
for ourselves.
弄清楚它
为了我们自己。

20:55.379 --> 20:56.724
Oh, boys?
哦，男孩们？

21:01.206 --> 21:03.448
That's it...
A little to the left.
就是这样...
向左一点。

21:03.551 --> 21:04.620
Curse you plankton
诅咒你的浮游生物

21:04.724 --> 21:06.517
and your ability
to join together
和你的能力
一起加入

21:06.620 --> 21:08.655
to form a working human ear.
形成一个能工作的人耳。

21:13.379 --> 21:15.896
Hot dog!
热狗！

21:17.344 --> 21:18.586
Yes!
是的！

21:18.689 --> 21:21.896
It's mine! The formula's mine!
这是我的！公式是我的！

21:22.000 --> 21:25.034
After all these years,
it's finally mine!
这么多年过去了，
它终于是我的了！

21:28.586 --> 21:31.172
Let it be known that on this day
让大家知道，在这一天

21:31.275 --> 21:34.379
I, Sheldon J. Plankton
我，谢尔顿·J·浮游生物

21:34.482 --> 21:38.241
single-handedly overthrew
The Krusty Krab!
一手推翻
蟹堡王！

21:38.344 --> 21:41.068
Ahem!
咳咳！

21:42.793 --> 21:47.482
A-And if course, I had
a little help from the family.
A-当然，我有
来自家人的一点帮助。

21:47.586 --> 21:50.034
Plankton, wait!
You can't look
at the formula!
浮游生物，等等！
你不能看
在公式中！

21:50.137 --> 21:51.931
Begging won't help.
乞讨是没有帮助的。

21:52.034 --> 21:54.620
I'm telling you,
you won't be able
to handle the truth.
我告诉你，
你将无法
来处理真相。

21:54.724 --> 21:56.517
There's some things
in this world
有一些事
在这个世界上

21:56.620 --> 21:58.586
that weren't meant
for mortal eyes.
那不是这个意思
对于凡人的眼睛。

21:58.689 --> 21:59.793
Eye.
眼睛。

21:59.896 --> 22:01.068
Eye.
眼睛。

22:01.172 --> 22:02.551
I don't care.
我不在乎。

22:02.655 --> 22:05.551
Drumroll, please!
请击鼓！

22:06.862 --> 22:09.413
Finally, after all these years
终于，经过这么多年

22:09.517 --> 22:14.103
I'm about to find out what makes
a Krabby Patty taste so good.
我正要找出是什么让
蟹肉饼味道真好。

22:14.206 --> 22:18.413
The secret recipe
for one Krabby Patty is...
秘方
对于蟹比帕蒂来说...

22:18.517 --> 22:20.103
"A pinch of salt..."
“少许盐……”

22:20.206 --> 22:21.482
Plankton, wait!
浮游生物，等等！

22:21.586 --> 22:24.482
"three teaspoons
of chopped onions..."
“三茶匙
切碎的洋葱……”

22:24.586 --> 22:25.586
I'm warning you.
我警告你。

22:25.620 --> 22:27.931
"a cup of love..."
“一杯爱……”

22:28.034 --> 22:29.034
Don't do it!
不要这样做！

22:29.137 --> 22:30.448
"mixed together
“混合在一起

22:30.551 --> 22:33.448
"with the most important
ingredient of all...
“与最重要的
所有...的成分

22:33.551 --> 22:36.827
"four heaping pounds
of freshly ground...
“四磅重
新鲜磨碎的...

22:36.931 --> 22:39.793
plankton"?
浮游生物”？

22:40.862 --> 22:42.620
I warned you.
我警告过你。

22:55.793 --> 22:58.068
Hey, why ain't you running?
喂，你怎么不跑？

22:58.172 --> 22:59.965
Well, I can't read.
嗯，我读不了。

23:00.068 --> 23:01.551
Get out of here.
离开这里。

23:01.655 --> 23:03.241
Hyuh, hyuh, hyuh, hyuh.
嘿嘿嘿嘿嘿

23:06.586 --> 23:08.655
Hey, guys. Did
I miss anything?
嘿，伙计们。有吗
我错过了什么吗？

23:08.758 --> 23:11.689
Mr. Krabs, is this really
the secret ingredient
蟹老板，这真的是吗？
秘密成分

23:11.793 --> 23:13.482
for the Krabby Patty?
为了蟹肉饼？

23:13.586 --> 23:14.758
Of course not.
当然不是。

23:14.862 --> 23:16.827
And Plankton'll probably
figure that out
浮游生物可能会
弄清楚

23:16.931 --> 23:19.517
and be back again to find out
what the real formula is.
再次回来看看
真正的公式是什么。

23:19.620 --> 23:21.517
But don't worry, boys...
但别担心，孩子们……

23:21.620 --> 23:23.689
The formula's safe from harm.
该配方不会受到伤害。

23:23.793 --> 23:26.344
I got it hidden
in me most secret
hiding place...
我把它隐藏了
在我最秘密的地方
藏身之处...

23:26.448 --> 23:30.241
A place no one,
not even Plankton,
would ever figure out.
无人的地方，
连浮游生物都没有，
永远会弄清楚。

23:32.103 --> 23:35.413
Let me guess... it's at home
under your mattress.
让我猜猜...在家里
在你的床垫下。

23:36.655 --> 23:41.275
Curse you, Squidward!
诅咒你，章鱼哥！

